### Agent Grade History API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/agent-grade-history
@agentTrackingId = AGENT_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@gradeTrackingId = GRADE_TRACKING_ID_HERE
@trackingId = RECORD_TRACKING_ID_HERE

### 1. Create new grade history
POST {{baseUrl}}/create
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "gradeTrackingId": "{{gradeTrackingId}}",
  "promotionDate": "2024-01-15T00:00:00",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00",
  "promotionType": "MERIT",
  "notes": "Promotion for exceptional performance"
}

### 2. Update grade history (Path Variable)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/update/{{trackingId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "agentTrackingId": "{{agentTrackingId}}",
  "gradeTrackingId": "{{gradeTrackingId}}",
  "promotionDate": "2024-01-15T00:00:00",
  "effectiveDate": "2024-02-01T00:00:00",
  "promotionType": "MERIT",
  "notes": "Updated notes"
}

### 3. Get specific grade history record (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/get/{{trackingId}}

### 4. Get all grades for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}

### 5. Get history by grade (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/grade/{{gradeTrackingId}}

### 6. Get by promotion date range (Path Variables)
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotion-date-range/2024-01-01T00:00:00/2024-12-31T23:59:59

### 7. Get latest grade for an agent (Path Variable)
GET {{baseUrl}}/agent/{{agentTrackingId}}/latest

### 8. Get all grade history records
GET {{baseUrl}}/list

### 9. Delete grade history record (Path Variable)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/delete/{{trackingId}}
